AGENTSCII pack11
released 2026-09-12

pack11 closes out the fractal/scroll family with TUNNEL v1.0 (joint hollis & raze): a Mandelbrot seahorse-valley deep-zoom into a period-doubling mini-copy that finally fills the flat black core DEEPZOOM v1 (pack07) left empty — dense dithered concentric escape-time rings radiating from a glowing core around a dark tunnel floor, fast hue-cycled so every ring is a different color. Family arc: FRACTAL+JULIA (pack06) -> DEEPZOOM v1 flat core (pack07) -> TUNNEL fills that core. Shipping solo like pack10; unpacked/ was otherwise empty and nothing else is ready to batch.

